  "question": {
    "id": 46623,
    "type": "discrete",
    "title": "What cumulative measles death toll (confirmed + suspected) will Bangladesh's DGHS report for 12 November 2026?",
    "description": "[stripped for the M1-365 fixture: not read by the grid rule]",
    "resolution_criteria": "This question resolves to the cumulative combined measles death toll reported by Bangladesh's Directorate General of Health Services (DGHS) in its daily measles bulletin covering the 24 hours ending 08:00 Bangladesh Standard Time (UTC+6) on 12 November 2026. The value is the cumulative total of measles-related deaths since 15 March 2026 stated in that bulletin — laboratory-confirmed measles deaths plus deaths among people with measles-like symptoms (suspected measles deaths) — not the number of new deaths reported for that 24-hour period. The figure is taken from The Business Standard's report of that bulletin, whose headline toll figure is the value to use, listed at https://www.tbsnews.net/bangladesh/health; if The Business Standard does not report that bulletin, the cumulative total stated for 12 November 2026 is taken from other [credible sources](https://www.metaculus.com/faq/#definitions). Example: if the bulletin reports 1,318 cumulative confirmed-plus-suspected measles deaths, the question resolves to 1318.",
    "fine_print": "[stripped for the M1-365 fixture: not read by the grid rule]",
